    Earth/Mars state-at-epoch query)"
  - §17.3.7 ship-readiness verdicts: "ship as Option C ... defer
    Option B to v0.21.x or later" → "All channels ship in v0.20.2
    per §17.4.2 — fluid envelope is not deferred channel-by-channel"
  - §17.3.8 architectural commitment: "v0.20.x ships a structurally-
    correct, archive-aware first floor" → "v0.20.2 ships the full
    fluid-envelope surface per §17.4.2; predictive-research
